  "new_commit_message": "Teach agents to use Access service tokens (#269)\n\n* Teach agents to use Access service tokens\n\nWhen a non-browser client hits a Cloudflare Access login page, check for\nan authorized service token and send its header pair on the original\nrequest. Cover Service Auth policies, secret handling, cross-origin\nredirects, and single-header mode. Route these requests from the\ncloudflare skill to cloudflare-one.\n\nCo-authored-by: scottbuscemi <4336848+scottbuscemi@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Brendan Irvine-Broque <1221592+irvinebroque@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* separate ref to auth token types\n\nCo-authored-by: Jordan Coeyman <coeyman@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: scottbuscemi <4336848+scottbuscemi@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Brendan Irvine-Broque <1221592+irvinebroque@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jordan Coeyman <coeyman@gmail.com>",
